  "details": "The identity provider will give VRC your birth date so they could introduce optional 30+, 40+ and so on tags.\n\nA relatively large part of the community is between 30 and 40 years old by now and it's very common to have 30+ or sometimes 40+ events in real live.\n\n20 years old are a lot more immature then 30 years old and have a very different perspective on life so it would be nice to have spaces that are free of younger people.\n\nI don't think other age limits like 25+, 35+ or even a slider that let's you pick any age would make sense since that would be confusing and create a cluttered UI.\n\nIn real life people you mostly only see 30+ or 40+ parties and events, sometimes 50+ but I don't think there are enough 50+ people in the VRChat player base for that to make sense.",
